# ============================================================================
#  Never commit data, indexes, logs, models, or subscriber content.
#  This repository ships CODE and DOCS only — no 3GPP spec text, no captures.
# ============================================================================

# --- spec index & any database (would contain copyrighted 3GPP text) ---
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
data/
**/spec_index*

# --- captured logs / traces / decodes ---
logs/
Logs_*/
**/_FAILURE_TESTS/logs*/
**/pcaps/
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.log
*.dat

# --- site-specific / sensitive config ---
vendor_terms.txt
*.env
.env

# --- large media working files (commit only the finished shots you choose) ---
media/*.mp4
media/*.mov
media/*.raw

# --- python / os cruft ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.venv/
venv/
